      "Supplied ALA 12/21 matches. Year facet at 10 km sums to 20 because of the undated Teesdale row. iNaturalist 2/2, both research grade.",
      "Roadkill and salvage rows are dead animals, not dens. The 1975 Inverleigh coordinate is the town centroid.",
      "The EPBC row Trichosurus vulpecula arnhemensis is the northern subspecies, not the local animal. Museums Victoria's endangered Central Australian subspecies is also not this population.",
