      "hangouts": "One row only, outside 5 km: 19 December 2016, ALA species sightings and OzAtlas, human observation, locality 19 Ware Street, Teesdale VIC 3328, about 8.3 km, no coordinate uncertainty stored. No iNaturalist observation inside 10 km. This is a single street address from a sightings project, not a trapped series, and it is not treated as a resident population.",
      "threats": "Not stated on the Museums Victoria page. Loss of logs would remove the habitat the page calls critical, but that is an inference and is not stated as a threat.",
