      "impacts": "The impact statement is the DEECA program text used for all four deer: grazing, browsing, rubbing, trampling, wallows, weeds and erosion, with added pressure on native wildlife. The FFG potentially-threatening-process sentence on that page is specifically about Sambar. It is not copied onto red deer. No red-deer locality inside 50 km names Inverleigh.",
